# #1360 part 4: the blocklist builder's block on a real CHR 7.18.2, 2026-10-02.
# Rendered by scripts/routeroscommands -step=blocklist (all seven lists on, catalogue
# defaults, push re-set with a placeholder address and token) and pasted one console
# command at a time by scripts/live-blocklist-chr.sh. The push itself fails at its
# fetch (mikroview.invalid): that is the placeholder, not the block. Each list was
# fetched once, from its source, by the router.

